Subject: Structure of the precision matrix of JRSS paper's disease mapping example
Message-ID: <CyuZNM31IhA.bxBoFrucFgAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/CyuZNM31IhA/m/bxBoFrucFgAJ>
